   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Receiving an action",
     "texto": [
      "**被** introduces who or what receives an action: object + 被 + agent + verb. For example, 我的自行车被工人修好了 = «the worker fixed my bicycle».",
      "If it doesn't matter who did the action, the agent can be left out: 门被关上了 = «the door was closed». Chinese uses 被 to mark the passive; in English we usually use «was» plus a past participle, as in «the door was closed»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
